Output assets/demo-search.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 40
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type `clear`
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type `yp "로파이 재즈 힙합"`
Enter
Sleep 8s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
